  "title": "FTC Solar Announces 1,000MW Expansion to Tracker Supply Agreement with Strata Clean Energy",
  "summary": "AUSTIN, Texas, March 10, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- FTC Solar, Inc. (Nasdaq: FTCI), a leading provider of solar tracker systems, software, and engineering services, announced today that it has signed a five-year, 1,000MW (1 gigawatt) expansion to its tracker supply agreement with Strata Clean Energy",
